<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('_head', { title: 'Konfigurasi Rank' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('_nav', { admin, section }) %>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 space-y-6">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white">Konfigurasi Rank & Event EXP</h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">Disimpan ke database — berlaku untuk user login (server) & tamu (konfig ikut dikirim ke browser). Rumus tetap: <b>EXP/level = 100 × nomor rank</b>, level maks = <code>min</code> rank terakhir.</p>
        </div>

        <% if (flash && flash.ok) { %><div class="flash-ok"><%= flash.ok %></div><% } %>
        <% if (flash && flash.err) { %><div class="flash-err"><%= flash.err %></div><% } %>

        <form method="POST" action="/admin/ranks" class="space-y-6" onsubmit="return checkJson()">
            <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-white">Daftar Rank (JSON)</h2>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-600">min = level mulai, harus menaik & mulai dari 1</span>
                </div>
                <textarea id="ranksTa" name="ranks" rows="14" class="input font-mono !text-xs" spellcheck="false"><%= JSON.stringify(cfg.ranks, null, 2) %></textarea>
            </section>

            <section class="card rounded-2xl p-5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-white">Event EXP (JSON)</h2>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-600">key: huruf kecil/angka/underscore · cap = batas/hari</span>
                </div>
                <textarea id="eventsTa" name="events" rows="10" class="input font-mono !text-xs" spellcheck="false"><%= JSON.stringify(cfg.events, null, 2) %></textarea>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-600 mt-3">Event baru tidak otomatis muncul di UI — kode client juga perlu memanggil <code>WibuLevel.grant('key_event')</code>. Event bawaan: <code>daily_visit</code>, <code>watch</code>, <code>bookmark</code>, <code>search</code>.</p>
            </section>

            <div id="jsonErr" class="flash-err hidden"></div>
            <button class="btn">💾 Simpan Konfigurasi</button>
        </form>
    </main>

    <script>
        function checkJson() {
            var err = document.getElementById('jsonErr')
            try {
                JSON.parse(document.getElementById('ranksTa').value)
                JSON.parse(document.getElementById('eventsTa').value)
                err.classList.add('hidden')
                return true
            } catch (e) {
                err.textContent = 'JSON tidak valid: ' + e.message
                err.classList.remove('hidden')
                window.scrollTo(0, document.body.scrollHeight)
                return false
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
